hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1386","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jisney jhooti qism khai taake uskey zariey wo kisi musalman ka maal hathiya ley to wo Allah Taala sey is haal mein milega ke Allah Taala us sey naraz hoga.'' Ash-as bin Qais (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain : Allah ki qism ! aap ney merey silsiley mein ye hadees bayan farmaai thi. merey aur eik Yahudi key darmiyan eik zamin mushtarak thi, usney merey hissey ka inkar kiya to main usey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas ley gaya, Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney mujh sey puchha : ''kya tumharey paas koi gawah hai? ''main ney arz kiya : nahin, to aap ney Yahudi sey farmaya : ''tum qism khaao'' mainey arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! wo to qism kha lega aur mera maal hazam kar ley ga. is par Allah Taala ney ye aayat nazil farmaee :«إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا"
"1387","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jab baaey (bechney wala) aur mushtari (kharidney wala) mein ikhtilaf ho jaey to baat baaey (bechney wala) ki maana jaeygi, aur mushtari (kharidney wala) ko ikhtiyar hoga.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees mursal hai, Aun bin Abdullah ney ibne-Masood ko nahin paya. 2- aur Qasim bin Abdur-Rehman sey bhi ye hadees marvi (riwayat hui) hai, unhoney ibne-Masood sey aur ibne-Masood ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat ki hai. aur ye riwayat bhi mursal hai. 3- Is-haq bin Mansoor kehtey hain : mainey Ahmed sey puchha : jab baaey (bechney wala) aur mushtari (kharidney wala) mein ikhtilaf ho jaey aur koi gawah na ho to kis ki baat taslim ki jaeygi? unhoney kaha : baat wohi moatabar hogi jo saaman ka Malik kaheyga, ya phir dono apni apni chiz wapis ley lein yani baaey (bechney wala) saaman wapis ley ley aur mushtari (kharidney wala) qeemat. Is-haq bin Raahviya ney bhi yahi kaha hai jo Ahmed ney kaha hai. 4- aur baat jiski bhi maana jaey uskey zimme qism khana hoga. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : Tabe-een mein sey baaz ehle-ilm sey isi tarah marvi (riwayat hui) hai, inhi mein Shureh bhi hain."
"1388","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney pani bechney sey mana farmaya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Ayas ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Jabir , Buhesa , Buhesa key baap , Abu-Hurera , Aaisha , Anas aur Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- aksar ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai, in logon ney pani bechney ko najaaiz kaha hai, yehi ibne-Mubarak Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi qol hai. 4- aur baaz ehle-ilm ney pani bechney ki ijazat di hai, jin mein Hasan Basri bhi shamil hain."
"1389","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''zarurat sey zayed pani sey na roka jaey ke uskey sabab ghaas sey rok diya jaey.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1390","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney nar ko mada par chhodney ki ujrat leney sey mana farmaya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Abu-Hurera , Anas aur abu-Saeed (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. baaz ulama ney is kaam par bakhshish qubul karney ki ijazat di hai, jamhur (ziyada aalimon) key nazdik ye haram hai."
"1391","Qabeela Kilaab key eik aadmi ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey nar ko mada par chhodney ki ujrat leney key barey mein puchha to aap ney isey mana kar diya, phir usney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! hum mada par nar chhodtey hain to hamein bakhshish di jati hai (to is ka hukm kya hai?) aap ney isey bakhshish leney ki ijazat dey di. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. hum isey sirf Ibrahim bin Humed hi ki riwayat sey jantey hain jisey unhoney Hisham bin Urwa sey riwayat ki hai."
"1392","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''pachhna laganey waley ki kamai khabees (ghatiya) hai padhi. zaaniya ki ujrat napak padhi. hai aur kuttey ki qeemat napak hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Raafey (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein umr , Ali , ibne-Masood , abu-Masood , Jabir , Abu-Hurera , ibne-Abbas , ibne-Umar aur Abdullah ibn Jaafar Raziallahu anhum sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- aksar ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. in logon ney kuttey ki qeemat ko najaaiz jaana hai, yehi Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi qol hai. aur baaz ehle-ilm ney shikari kuttey ki qeemat ki ijazat di hai."
"1393","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney kuttey ki qeemat , zaaniya ki kamai aur kaahin ki mithaai sey mana farmaya hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1394","Unhoney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey pachhna laganey waley ki ujrat ki ijazat talab ki, to aap ney unhen is sey mana farmaya padhi. lekin wo baar-baar aap sey poochhtey aur ijazat talab kartey rahey yahan tak ke aap ney farmaya : ''isey apney oont key chaare par kharch karo ya apney ghulam ko khila do.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Mahisa ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Raafey bin Khadees, Juhaifa, Jabir aur Saaib bin Yazeed sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. 4- Ahmed kehtey hain : agar mujh sey koi pachhna laganey wala mazduri talab karey to main nahin dunga aur daleel mein yehi hadees pesh karunga."
"1395","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey pachhna laganey waley ki kamai key barey mein puchha gaya to Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney pachhna lagwaayaa , aur aap ko pachhna laganey waley abu-Taiba they, to aap ney unhen do saa ghalla deney ka hukm diya aur unkey malikon sey baat ki, to unhoney abu-Taiba key Khiraaj (tex) mein kami kar di aur aap ney farmaya : ''jin chizon sey tum dawaa kartey ho un mein sab sey afzal pachhna hai.'' ya farmaya : ''tumhari behtar dawaaon mein sey pachhna hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Ali , ibne-Abbas aur ibne-Umar (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ney pachhna laganey waley ki ujrat ko jayez qarar diya hai. yehi Shafai ka bhi qol hai."
"1396","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney kuttey aur billi ki qeemat sey mana farmaya hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is hadees ki sanad mein iztirab hai. billi ki qeemat key barey mein ye sahih nahin hai, 2- ye hadees Aamash sey marvi hai unhoney apney baaz as-haab sey riwayat ki hai aur usney Jabir sey, ye log Aamash sey is hadees ki riwayat mein iztirab ka shikar hain, 3- aur ibn Fazal ney is sanad key ilawa dusri sanad sey b-tareeq : « Aamash , an abi Hazim, an abi Hurera , an Nabi sallallahu Alehi wasallam » riwayat ki hai, 4- ehle-ilm ki eik jamaat ney billi ki qeemat ko najaaiz kaha hai, 5- aur baaz logon ney uski rukhsat di hai, yehi Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi qol hai."
"1397","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney billi aur uski qeemat khaney sey mana farmaya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, 2- aur hum abdur-Razzaaq key ilawa kisi badey muhaddis ko nahin jantey jisney Amr bin Zaid sey riwayat ki ho."
"1398","kuttey ki qeemat sey) Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney ( mana farmaya hai siwaye shikari kuttey ki qeemat key. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is tareeq sey sahih nahin hai, 2- abu-Mohazzim ka naam Yazeed bin Sufiyan hai, unkey silsiley mein Shoba bin hujjaaj ney kalam kya hai aur un ki tazeef ki hai, 3- aur Jabir sey marvi hai unhoney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey usi jaisi hadees riwayat ki hai, aur iski sanad bhi sahih nahin hai (dekhein Sahiha : 2971)"
"1399","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' gaaney wali laundiyon ko na becho aur na unhen kharido , aur na unhen ( gaanaa ( sikhaao , un ki tijarat mein khair o barkat nahin hai aur un ki qeemat haram hai. aur usi jaisi chizon key barey mein ye aayat utri hai : (ومن الناس من يشتري لهو الحديث ليضل an سبيل الله)''aur baaz log aisey hain jo laghw baaton ko kharid letey hain taake logon ko Allah ki raah sey behkaaeyn'' (luqman : 6) ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- abu-Umama ki hadees ko hum is tarah sirf isi tareeq sey jantey hain, aur baaz ehle-ilm ney Ali bin Yazeed key barey mein kalam kya hai aur unki tazeef ki hai. aur ye Sham key rehney waley hain, padhi. 2- is bab mein umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"1400","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney faisley mein rishwat deney waley aur rishwat leney waley dono par lanat bheji hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- ye hadees abu-Salma bin Abdur-Rehman sey bhi marvi (riwayat hui) hai unhen Abdullah bin Amr sey aur unhoney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat ki hai. 3- aur abu-Salma sey unkey baap key wastey sey bhi marvi (riwayat hui) hai unhoney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat ki hai lekin ye sahih nahin hai. 4- mainey Abdullah bin Abdur-Rehman Darmi ko kehtey suna ke abu-Salma ( abu-Salma bin Abdur-Rehman ( ki hadees jisey unhoney Abdullah bin Amr sey aur unhoney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat ki hai is baab mein sab sey ziyada achvhhi aur sab sey ziyada sahih hai) jo aagey aa rahi hai ). 5- is bab mein Abdullah bin Amr , Aaisha , ibne Hadida aur Umme-Salma (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain."
"1401","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney rishwat deney waley aur rishwat leney waley dono par lanat bheji hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1402","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''agar mujhey khur bhi hadiya ki jaey to main qubul karunga aur agar mujhey uski dawat di jaey to main qubul karunga.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Anas ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Ali , Aaisha , Mughira bin Shoba , Salman , Muawiya bin Haida aur Abdur-Rehman bin Alqama (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain."
"1403","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''tum log apna muqadma ley kar merey paas aatey ho main eik insan hi hun, ho sakta hai ke tum mein sey koi aadmi apna daawey bayan karney mein doosrey sey ziyada charb zabaan ho padhi. to agar main kisi ko uskey musalman bhai ka koi haq dilwa dun to goya main usey jahannam ka eik tukda kaat kar dey raha hun, lihaza wo is mein sey kuchh bhi na ley.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Umme-Salma ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Abu-Hurera aur Aaisha sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"1404","Do aadmi eik Hazare-maut sey aur eik Kanda sey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas aaye. Hizrami ney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! is (Kandi ( ney meri zamin par qabza kar liya hai, is par Kandi ney kaha : ye meri zamin hai aur merey qabze mein hai, is par is (Hizrami) ka koi haq nahin hai. Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney Hizrami sey puchha : '' tumharey paas koi gawah hai?''  usney arz kiya : nahin, aap ney farmaya : ''phir to tum us sey qism hi ley saktey ho.'' , us aadmi ney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! wo faajir (badkaar) aadmi hai usey iski parwah nahin ke wo kis baat par qism kha raha hai. aur na wo kisi chiz sey ehtiyat barat'ta hai, aap ney farmaya : ''us sey tum qism hi ley saktey ho.'' aadmi qism khaney chala to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney jab wo peeth pher kar janey laga farmaya : agar is ney zulm ke saath tumhara maal khaney key liye qism khai hai to wo Allah Taala sey us haal mein milega ke Allah us sey rukh pherey hoga. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Wayl bin Hajar ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein umr , ibne-Abbas , Abdullah bin Amr , aur Ash-as bin Qais (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain."
"1405","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney apney khutbe mein farmaya : ''gawah muddai key zimme hai aur qism muddai aleh key zimme hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : is hadees ki sanad mein kalam hai. Muhammad bin Ubedullah Arzami apney hifz key talluq sey hadees mein zaeef gardaney jatey hain. ibne-Mubarak waghera ney in ko zaeef thehraaya hai."
"1406","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney faisla kiya ke qism muddai aleh par hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai ke gawah muddai key zimme hai aur qism muddai aleh par hai."
"1407","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney eik gawah key sath muddai ki qism sey (muddai key haq mein) faisla diya. Rabeea kehtey hain : mujhey Saad bin Ubada key betey ney khabar di ke hamney Saad (Raziallahu anhu) ki kitab mein likha paya ke Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney ''eik gawah aur muddai ki qism sey (muddai key haq mein) faisla diya.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is baab mein Ali , Jabir , ibne-Abbas aur Suraq (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 2- Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees ke ''nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney eik gawah aur muddai ki qism sey (muddai key haq mein) faisla kiy '' Hasan gharib hai."
"1408","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney eik gawah aur muddai ki qism sey (muddai key haq mein) faisla diya."
"1409","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney eik gawah key sath muddai ki qism sey (muddai key haq mein) faisla kiya, Raavi kehtey hain : aur Ali ney bhi isi sey tumharey darmiyan faisla kiya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees ziyada sahih hai. 2- isi tarah Sufiyan Sory ney bhi ba-tareeq : (an Jaafar bin Muhammad an Abeeh an Nabi Sallallahu Alehi wasallam) mursalan riwayat ki hai. aur Abdul-Azeez bin abu-Salma aur Yahya bin Saleem ney is hadees ko ba-tareeq : (an Jaafar bin Muhammad an Abeeh an Ali an Nabi Sallallahu Alehi wasallam) (marfooan) riwayat kiya hai. 3- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai, un logon ki raey hai ke huquq aur amwaal key silsiley main eik gawah key sath muddai ko qism khilana jayez hai. Malik bin Anas , Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi yehi qol hai. ye log kehtey hain ke eik gawah key sath muddai ki qism sey sirf huquq aur amwaal key silsiley hi mein faisla kiya jaeyga. 4- aur ehle-koofa waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm eik gawah key sath muddai ki qism sey faisla karney ko jayez nahin samajhtey."
"1410","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jisney kisi mushtaraka (saajha) ghulam mein sey apna hissea azaad kiya.'' , aur uskey paas itna maal ho jo ghulam ki waajibi qeemat ko pahunch raha ho to wo us maal sey baqi sharikon ka hissa ada karega aur ghulam (pura) azad ho jaeyga warna jitna azad huwa hai utna hi azad hoga.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- isey Salim bin Abdullah ney bhi ba-tareeq : (an Abeeh an Nabi Sallallahu Alehi wasallam) isi tarah riwayat kiya hai."
"1411","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jisney mushtaraka (saajha) ghulam mein sey apna hissa azad kiya aur uskey paas itna maal ho jo uski qeemat ko pahunch raha ho (to wo baqi sharikon ka hissa bhi ada karega) aur wo iskey maal sey azad ho jaeyga.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1412","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jisney mushtaraka (saajha) ghulam mein sey apna hissa azad kiya to baqi hissey ki azadi bhi usi key maal sey hogi agar uskey paas maal hai, aur agar uskey paas maal nahin hai to us ghulam ki waajibi qeemat lagai jaeygi, phir ghulam ko pareshani mein daley baghair usey moqey diya jaeyga ke wo kamai kar key us shakhs ka hissa ada kar dey jisney apna hissa azad nahin kiya hai.'' Muhammad bin Bashaar sey bhi aisi hi riwayat hai aur is mein « شقصاً » key bajaey « شقیصا ». Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- aur isi tarah Aban bin Yazeed ney Qatada sey Saeed bin Abi Aruba ki hadees key jaisi riwayat ki hai. 3- aur Shoba ney bhi is hadees ko Qatada sey riwayat kiya hai aur is mein unhoney us sey azadi key liye kamai karaney ka zikr nahin kiya hai. 4- siaaya (kamai karaney) key silsiley mein ehle-ilm ka ikhtilaf hai, baaz ehle-ilm ney is barey mein siaaya ko jayez kaha hai. aur yehi Sufiyan Sory aur ehle-koofa ka bhi qol hai, aur Is-haq bin Raahviya bhi isi key qaail hain. 5- is bab mein Abdullah bin Amr Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi riwayat hai, 6- aur baaz ehle-ilm ney kaha hai ke jab ghulam do aadmiyon mein mushtaraka ho aur un mein sey eik apna hissa azad kar dey to agar uskey paas maal ho to wo apney saajhidaar key hissey ka tawaan (jurmaana) ada karega aur ghulam usi key maal sey azad ho jaeyga, aur agar uskey paas maal nahin hai to ghulam ko jitna azad kya gaya hai utna azad hoga, aur baqi hissey ki azadi key liye us sey kamai nahin karaai jaeygi. aur un logon ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey marvi (riwayat hui) ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma ki hadees ki taraf sey ye baat kahi hai, aur yehi ehale Madina ka bhi qol hai. aur Malik bin Anas , Shafai aur Ahmed bhi isi key qaail hain."
"1413","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''umraa (umr bhar ke liye koi cheez ya hadiya) jis ko diya gaya uskey ghar walon ka ho jata hai.''  ya farmaya : ''umraa jis ko diya gaya uskey ghar walon ki meeras hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : is baab mein Zaid bin Sabit , Jabir , Abu-Hurera , Aaisha , Abdullah bin Zuber aur Muawiya (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain."
"1414","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jis aadmi ko umraa (umr bhar ke liye koi cheez ya hadiya) diya gaya wo uska hai aur uskey ghar walon yani waarison ka hai kyonkey wo usi ka ho jata hai jis ko diya jata hai, umra deney waley ki taraf nahin laut'taa hai isliye ke usney aisa Atiya diya hai jis mein meeras sabit ho gaee hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- aur isi tarah Maamar aur deegar kaee logon ney Zohri sey Malik ki riwayat hi ki tarah riwayat ki hai aur baaz ney Zohri sey riwayat ki hai, magar usney is mein « ولعقبه » ka zikr nahin kiya hai. 3- aur ye hadees iskey ilawa aur bhi sanadon sey Jabir sey marvi hai ke Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''umraa jis ko diya jata hai uskey ghar walon ka ho jata hai.'' aur is mein « لعقبه » ka zikr nahin hai. ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 4- baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai, ye log kehtey hain ke jab deney wala ye kahey ke ye teri umr tak tera hai aur terey baad teri aulad ka hai to ye usi ka hoga jis ko diya gaya hai. aur deney waley key paas lot kar nahin jaeyga aur jab wo ye na kahey ke (teri aulad) ka bhi hai to jisey diya gaya hai uskey marney key baad deney waley ka ho jaeyga. Malik bin Anas aur Shafai ka yehi qol hai. 5- aur deegar kaee sanadon sey marvi hai ke Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''umraa (umr bhar ke liye koi cheez ya hadiya) jisey diya gaya hai uskey ghar walon ka ho jaeyga.''  6- baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. wo kehtey hain : jis ko ghar diya gaya hai uskey marney key baad wo ghar uskey warison ka ho jaeyga agar-che uskey warison ko na diya gaya ho. Sufiyan Sory , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka yehi qol hai."
"1415","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''umraa (umr bhar ke liye koi cheez ya hadiya) jis ko diya gaya uskey ghar walon ka hai aur raqbaa bhi jis ko diya gaya hai uskey ghar walon ka hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai. 2- aur baaz ney isi sanad sey abu-Zubair sey riwayat ki hai ke unhoney isey Jabir sey moqufan naqal kiya hai, isey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam tak marfoo nahin kiya hai. 3- Ruqbaa ki tafseer ye hai ke koi aadmi kahey ke ye chiz jab tak tum zinda rahogey tumhari hai aur agar tum mujh sey pehley mar gaey to ye phir meri taraf lot aayegi. 4- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai ke umra ki tarah ruqbaa bhi jisey diya gaya hai uskey ghar walon hi ka hoga. Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka yehi qol hai. aur ehle-koofa waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ney umra aur ruqbaa key darmiyan farq kiya hai, un logon ney umra ko to Maamar (jis key naam chiz di gaee thi) ki maut key baad uskey waarison ka haq bataya hai aur ruqba ko kaha hai ke waarison ka haq nahin hoga balke wo deney wali ki taraf lot jaeyga."
"1416","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''suleh musalman key darmiyan nafiz (laagu) hogi siwaye aisi suleh key jo kisi halal ko haram kar dey ya kisi haram ko halal. aur musalman apni sharton key paband hain. siwaye aisi shart key jo kisi halal ko haram kar dey ya kisi haram ko halal.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1417","Mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey suna : ''jab tum mein sey kisi ka padosi uski deewar mein lakdi gaadney ki us sey ijazat talab karey to wo usey na rokey.'' Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ney jab ye hadees bayan ki to logon ney apney sar jhuka liye to unhoney kaha : kya baat hai, main dekh raha hun ke tum log is sey aeraz kar (bach) rahey ho? Allah ki qism main isey tumharey shaanon (kandhon) par maar kar hi rahunga yani tum sey isey bayan kar key hi rahunga. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein ibne-Abbas aur Majmaa bin Jaariya (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. Shafai bhi isi key qaail hain. 4- baaz ehle-ilm sey marvi (riwayat hui) hai : jin mein Malik bin Anas bhi shamil hain ke uskey liye durust hai ke apney padosi ko deewar mein lakdi gaadney sey mana kar dey, pehla qol ziyada sahih hai."
"1418","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''qasam usi chiz par waqey hogi jis par tumhara sathi (mukhalif paksh) qism ley raha hai (tauriya ka aetbar nahin hoga).'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- hum isey Hasheem hi ki riwayat sey jantey hain jisey unhoney Abdullah bin Abi Saleh sey riwayat ki hai. aur Abdullah bin Abi Saleh , Suhel bin abi Saleh key bhai hain. 3- baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai, Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya bhi isi key qaail hain. 4- Ibrahim Nakhai kehtey hain ke jab qism leney wala zalim ho to qism khaney waley ki niyat ka aetbar hoga, aur jab qism leney wala mazloom ho to qism leney waley ki niyat ka aetbar hoga."
"1419","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''raasta saat haath (chaudaa) rakho.''"
"1420","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jab raastey key silsiley main tum mein ikhtilaf ho to usey saat haath (chaudaa) rakho.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye (pichhli) Wakee ki hadees sey ziyada sahih hai. 2- Bashir bin Kaab ki hadees jisey unhoney Abu-Hurera sey riwayat ki hai Hasan sahih hai, aur baaz ney isey Qatada sey aur Qatada ney Bashir bin Nuhaiq sey aur Bashir ney Abu-Hurera sey riwayat ki hai aur ye ghair mehfooz hai, 3- is bab mein ibne-Abbas sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"1421","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney eik bachchey ko ikhtiyar diya ke chahey wo apney baap key sath rahey aur chahey apni maa key sath. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Abdullah bin Amr aur Abdul-Hameed bin Jaafar key dada (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ka isi hadees par amal hai, ye log kehtey hain ke jab maa baap key darmiyan bachchey key silsiley mein ikhtilaf ho jaey to bachchey ko ikhtiyar diya jaeyga chahey wo apney baap key sath rahey aur chahey wo apni maa key sath rahey. yehi Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka qol hai. unka kehna hai ke jab bachcha kam-sin ho to uski maa ziyada mustahiq hai. aur jab wo saat saal ka ho jaey to us ko ikhtiyar diya jaey, chahey to baap key sath rahey ya chahey to maa key sath rahey."
"1422","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''sab sey pakizah chiz jis ko tum khatey ho tumhari apni kamai hai aur tumhari aulad bhi tumhari kamai mein sey hai.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- baaz logon ney Imaara bin Umer sey aur Imaara ney apni maa sey aur un ki maa ney Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) sey riwayat ki hai, lekin aksar raawiyon ney « an أمّه » key bajaey « an عمته » kaha hai yani Imaara bin Umer ney apni phuphi sey aur unhoney Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) sey riwayat ki hai. 3- is bab mein Jabir aur Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain. 4- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. wo kehtey hain ke baap ko betey key maal mein kulli ikhtiyar hai wo jitna chahey ley sakta hai. 5- aur baaz kehtey hain ke baap apney betey key maal sey ba-waqt zarurat hi ley sakta hai."
